//! The `background-position` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets
//! the initial position for each background image.
//!
//! Initial: 0% 0%. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to the size of the background positioning area minus size of background image;
